The model it runs is not included. It is a Core ML conversion (made with the scripts in scripts/, which adapt
FluidInference möbius, https://github.com/FluidInference/mobius, Apache-2.0) of AI4Bharat's IndicConformer 600M
multilingual (https://github.com/AI4Bharat/IndicConformerASR), MIT License.

The test fixtures (Tests/IndicSpeechTests/Fixtures) contain 3-second excerpts and model outputs for utterances
from Google's FLEURS test set (https://huggingface.co/datasets/google/fleurs), CC-BY-4.0.
